        "narration": "Priya is baking cookies. One recipe needs 5/8 cup of sugar. Another recipe needs 3/8 cup. Which recipe uses more sugar?",
        "text": "5/8 cup or 3/8 cup?",
        "visual": null
      },
      {
        "narration": "The denominators match, so the pieces are the same size. Just compare the numerators. Five eighths is greater than three eighths.",
        "text": "5/8 is greater than 3/8",
        "visual": null
      },
      {
        "narration": "Next, Priya compares 3/4 cup and 3/8 cup. The numerators match this time. Fourths are bigger pieces than eighths, so 3/4 is greater than 3/8.",
        "text": "Same numerator: the smaller denominator is greater",
        "visual": null
      },
      {
        "narration": "Benchmarks help. Half of 8 is 4, so 3/8 is less than 1/2. Half of 6 is 3, so 5/6 is more than 1/2. That makes 5/6 greater than 3/8.",
